{"id":7699758022831,"title":"NMK950 W10 Pilot Tonneau Case: Steel Finish","handle":"nmk950-pilot-tonneau-case-steel-finish","description":"\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe Tonneau or barrel-shaped W10 military watch has a distinct and storied history. The W10 specification was part of a series of military watch specifications that were used by the British Ministry of Defence (MoD) from the mid-20th century. The W10 specification, in particular, was introduced in the 1970s and became a defining style for military-issued timepieces.\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThe \u003cstrong\u003eNMK950 W10 Pilot Tonneau Case in Steel Finish\u003c\/strong\u003e stays true to the original with a 36mm case diameter and features a contemporary top hat box crystal.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\" dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\" style=\"text-decoration: underline;\" data-mce-style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"\u003e\u003cem data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCase Specifications:\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eCase Diameter: 36mm\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eLug to Lug: 41.3mm\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eThickness: 11.2mm (with Crystal and Caseback)\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eLug Width: 18mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cstrong data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eWhat's Included?\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e- Top Hat Box Crystal (Clear AR)\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e- Integrated Brushed Chapter Ring (Rehaut)\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e- Matching Sterile Crown\u003cbr data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e- Caseback Gasket\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e","published_at":"2024-01-24T11:08:49+08:00","created_at":"2024-01-05T16:35:50+08:00","vendor":"IV","type":"NMK Cases","tags":